<法規內容>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 1</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[The standards are prescribed in accordance with the provisions of Article 17 of the Act Governing Food Safety and Sanitation (hereinafter referred to as "this Act").]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 2</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[The scope of these standards encompasses microorganisms and their toxins or metabolites in food, excluding fungi and mycotoxins.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 3</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[The limits for microorganisms and their toxins or metabolites in food shall comply with the requirements specified in the Annex table.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 4</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[Food is found to be under any of the circumstances described in Subparagraph 4 of Paragraph 1 of Article 15 of this Act and Article 6 of the Rules for the Implementation of this Act, shall be subject to the provision of Paragraph 1 of Article 15 of this Act.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 5</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[The Standards shall be implemented on July 1, 2021.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
</法規內容>
</法規>
